This project adapts the command interface of Agent as Policy for Robotic Manipulation.
The upstream robot_client.py is distributed unmodified in src/agp_remote_yam/assets/.
Upstream: https://github.com/agent-as-policy-2026/agent-as-policy
Revision: 54dd96ed97c013950816bb674cbc38a68ec19b51
License: Apache-2.0, retained in licenses/AGP-APACHE-2.0.txt.

Remote YAM is an external pinned dependency, not vendored project source.
Its original license and notices remain in its separately installed checkout.
This adaptation does not claim to reproduce the paper's success rates or timed throwing.

MEMO method reference: https://collab.me.vt.edu/memo/
VT-Collab/memo revision d98cc8db145f429c8833a846d357395c935ddd3c.
The skillbook, service and adapters here are independently implemented. No
MEMO source code or upstream serialized skillbook is redistributed.
Semantic embeddings use sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 at the revision
recorded in dependency.lock.json; model weights are fetched separately under
their upstream license, not committed to this repository.
